#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _versions/main/guides/security-spiffe-client.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"https://spiffe.io/[SPIFFE] (Secure Production Identity Framework for Everyone) provides cryptographic workload identities in zero-trust environments.\n"
"The SPIFFE client extension uses the https://github.com/spiffe/spiffe/blob/main/standards/SPIFFE_Workload_API.md[Workload API] to retrieve https://github.com/spiffe/spiffe/blob/main/standards/JWT-SVID.md[JWT Verifiable Identity Documents (JWT-SVIDs)] for Quarkus workloads directly from the local https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spire-about/spire-concepts/[SPIRE Agent].\n"
"It simplifies deployment by eliminating the need for a SPIFFE client sidecar that stores JWT-SVIDs on a mounted file path for Quarkus to read."
msgstr "link:https://spiffe.io/[O SPIFFE] (Secure Production Identity Framework for Everyone) fornece identidades criptográficas para cargas de trabalho em ambientes de confiança zero. A extensão do cliente SPIFFE utiliza a link:https://github.com/spiffe/spiffe/blob/main/standards/SPIFFE_Workload_API.md[API de Cargas de Trabalho] para recuperar link:https://github.com/spiffe/spiffe/blob/main/standards/JWT-SVID.md[Documentos de Identidade Verificáveis JWT (JWT-SVIDs)] para cargas de trabalho do Quarkus diretamente do link:https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spire-about/spire-concepts/[Agente SPIRE] local. Isso simplifica a implantação, eliminando a necessidade de um sidecar do cliente SPIFFE que armazene JWT-SVIDs em um caminho de arquivo montado para que o Quarkus possa lê-los."

